OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'recognises seriousness'
OL,4,Aof bullying claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FBedford Borough Council has said it
OL,7,F"recognises the seriousness of the
OL,8,Ffindings" of a government inspection
OL,9,Fthat found evidence of bullying and a
OL,10,Fmisogynistic culture across political
OL,11,Fgroups.
OL,13,FInspectors also accused Conservative
OL,14,FMayor Tom Wootton of "avoiding
OL,15,Fdifficult decisions and conflict" and
OL,16,Fthis meant commissioners could be
OL,17,Foverseeing work at the council for the
OL,18,Fnext three years.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
