OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'recognises seriousness'
OL,4,Aof bullying claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority's chief executive
OL,7,FLaura Church said: "The council has
OL,8,Fcarefully considered the report's
OL,9,Frecommendations and recognises the need
OL,10,Fto accelerate our transformation and
OL,11,Fimprovement journey."
OL,13,FThe authority said it would continue
OL,14,Fits daily operations and address the
OL,15,Fissues raised in the full report.
